%% Service Architecture: All AWS services and how they connect
graph TB
    Internet["🌐 Internet / User"]

    CloudFront["☁️ CloudFront<br/>(CDN)"]

    S3Admin["📦 S3<br/>(Admin UI Assets)"]
    S3Media["📦 S3<br/>(Media/Images)"]

    APIGateway["🚪 API Gateway<br/>(REST Endpoints)"]

    Cognito["🔐 Cognito<br/>(Authentication)"]

    Lambda["⚡ Lambda / EC2<br/>(Payload CMS)"]
    Prisma["🔗 Prisma ORM<br/>(Schema & Queries)"]

    RDS["💾 RDS PostgreSQL<br/>(Database)"]

    VPC["🔒 VPC<br/>(Private Network)"]

    IAM["👤 IAM<br/>(Permissions)"]

    Internet -->|HTTP/HTTPS| CloudFront

    CloudFront -->|Cache Hit/Miss| S3Admin
    CloudFront -->|Cache Hit/Miss| S3Media
    CloudFront -->|Route| APIGateway

    APIGateway -->|Route| Lambda
    APIGateway -->|Validate Token| Cognito

    Lambda -->|Query/Insert/Update| Prisma
    Prisma -->|SQL Queries| RDS

    Lambda -->|Upload/Download| S3Media
    Lambda -->|Check Permissions| IAM
    Cognito -->|Check Permissions| IAM

    RDS -.->|Inside| VPC
    Lambda -.->|Inside| VPC

    style Internet fill:#ff9999
    style CloudFront fill:#99ccff
    style S3Admin fill:#99ff99
    style S3Media fill:#99ff99
    style APIGateway fill:#ffcc99
    style Cognito fill:#ff99ff
    style Lambda fill:#ccccff
    style Prisma fill:#ffcccc
    style RDS fill:#ffffcc
    style VPC fill:#e6e6e6
    style IAM fill:#ff99cc
